5% for every quarter in third year;
1% for every quarter in fourth and fifth year.', 'Depreciation Norms governs how DGFT business controls should be applied, validated, and enforced.', 'Depreciation Norms explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include (a) Depreciation Norms for Computers and Computer Peripherals:
Depreciation for computers and computer peripherals shall be as follows.', 'Indha Depreciation Norms section-la, Depreciation Norms explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include (a) Depreciation Norms for Computers and Computer Peripherals:
